static.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/2ee3aac758611e98c44ad0ceaa222beb.poster.avif?t=1788098907\" width=1120 height=400 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/2ee3aac758611e98c44ad0ceaa222beb.webm?t=1788098907\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/2ee3aac758611e98c44ad0ceaa222beb.mp4?t=1788098907\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics Chaos<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Balancing on a single wheel while tossing that bomb to your friend is definitely harder than it looks!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/8e19d769ea34551f6b53de96a1bb20e6.poster.avif?t=1788098907\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/8e19d769ea34551f6b53de96a1bb20e6.webm?t=1788098907\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/8e19d769ea34551f6b53de96a1bb20e6.mp4?t=1788098907\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Threats<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just blow up your friends, stand shoulder to shoulder to survive massive boss battles!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4286040\/extras\/956077978a7fd965d4b6d37b27ba31db.poster.avif?t=1788098907\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https:\